:"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Ye5nmTmZ7cL7BQshqZeIWQ","review_id":"9HkpmAXhIiE-poJd_geo2w","date":"2016-04-08T13:37:09","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9521621465682983,"text_excerpt":"McClure's has moved to NOLA City Brewing. They have a little kitchen within the tap room where you can order amazing BBQ. A group of friends and I visited NOLA Brewing after walking around Magazine St. It is about a .5 mile trek from the main shopping area of Magazine st. The BBQ is amazing, probably the best I have ever had. I had a pulled pork sandwich that was piled high with pork. They have 6 or so different sauce options from NOLA as well as Memphis version, Texas, and other versions from around the country. I tried a couple different ones and they all were amazing. The meat was so tender and the perfect balance of smoky and flavorful. We all stuffed our faces because the food was so..."},{"business_id":"Ye5nmTmZ7cL7BQshqZeIWQ","review_id":"A1dPHw0bPerwR3T8709MKA","date":"2019-01-27T15:08:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9444071650505066,"text_excerpt":"Went here wanting really good bbq and that's what we got. I got the brisket and it was flavorful and very moist with a large portion. We also tasted the pulled pork which was delicious. We each got different side so we could fast more my favorite was the molasses smothered greens not sweet as I thought they would be just very good. We also tried the Mac and cheese, a creole potato salad and bbq jambalaya. Each side was tasty and better than the typical joint. Also, we got a sampler of beers absolute love this idea you can choose the beers you want or we had the bar made chose for us. It's a great place to hang out for good food and great atmosphere"},{"business_id":"Ye5nmTmZ7cL7BQshqZeIWQ","review_id":"EFgVmglrCUMgoI82yDgf3g","date":"2012-04-11T10:57:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9444012641906738,"text_excerpt":"Holy pig and cow!!!! This place rocked my world tonight. I love me some good bbq and this was amazing. Now you can only go for dinner on Tuesday night at Dante's Kitchen (Dante's is closed that night) and McClure's is open for lunch everyday during the week. So you get for $15, four different pieces of meat, whatever they have for that night, I had brisket, a heap of pulled pork, two pork ribs and a chicken wing. They bring you a nice sized bowl of each side item and they were coleslaw, potato salad, corn bread, pork & beans, and mac 'n cheese. My favorite being the mac 'n cheese, it has bacon in it, my least favorite being the beans, a little too much cumin. Overall the food is amazing. ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Ye5nmTmZ7cL7BQshqZeIWQ","photo_id":"-dmQ1prF_kdFUOXaoXnbHA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/-dmQ1prF_kdFUOXaoXnbHA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8989942073822021},{"business_id":"Ye5nmTmZ7cL7BQshqZeIWQ","photo_id":"k0x48vwwmpHuoxHP-3g_Qg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/k0x48vwwmpHuoxHP-3g_Qg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8719450235366821},{"business_id":"Ye5nmTmZ7cL7BQshqZeIWQ","photo_id":"qTQpANYjFO6FOHYQo039Vg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/qTQpANYjFO6FOHYQo039Vg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8492343425750732},{"business_id":"Ye5nmTmZ7cL7BQshqZeIWQ","photo_id":"pD4rGokD17CnpjB_CfNclA","label":"inside","image_url":"/phot